        <mxCell id="EXIT" value="&lt;b&gt;Exit codes&lt;/b&gt; (kept from the OSMO workflow): 0 pass; 1 a real verdict, never retried;&lt;br/&gt;42 platform not ready and 137 OOM -&amp;gt; Argo retryStrategy with expression on exit code" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;align=left;spacingLeft=8;" vertex="1" parent="WT">
