        <mxCell id="DIFF" value="&lt;b&gt;Differences from OSMO&lt;/b&gt;: the run group is one pod, so shared memory, localhost DDS and gang start come from Kubernetes itself;&lt;br/&gt;no discovery-server task; no osmo-ctrl sidecar; artifacts move through the Argo artifact repository instead of osmo data" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;align=left;spacingLeft=8;" vertex="1" parent="WT">
